---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Sell it before you build it" description="E1C (Entrepreneur's First Choice) gives first-time entrepreneurs the tools and framework to prove an idea works before spending real time or money.">
  <section class="hero section--tight">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="mark" style="margin-bottom:28px;"></span>
      <h1>Sell it before you build it.</h1>
      <p class="lede">E1C (Entrepreneur's First Choice) gives first-time entrepreneurs the tools and framework to prove an idea works &mdash; before spending real time or money on it.</p>
      <div style="display:flex; gap:16px; margin-top:32px; flex-wrap:wrap;">
        <a href="/the-first-strategy/" class="btn btn--primary">Get The First Strategy Guide</a>
        <a href="/apps/" class="btn btn--secondary">See what we're building</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--alt">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="eyebrow">The problem</span>
      <h2>Most first-time entrepreneurs fail one of two ways.</h2>
      <p class="lede">They build something nobody asked for, or they research forever and never start. E1C exists to fix both &mdash; with a framework that tells you what's true before you commit real time or money.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="eyebrow">How E1C helps</span>
      <h2>Two things, built around the same idea</h2>
      <div class="grid grid--3" style="margin-top:32px;">
        <div class="card">
          <h3>The First Strategy</h3>
          <p class="muted">A free framework for testing your idea by selling it first &mdash; not surveying opinions about it.</p>
          <a href="/the-first-strategy/" class="btn btn--secondary" style="margin-top:12px;">Read the framework</a>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h3>Entrepreneur apps</h3>
          <p class="muted">Tools we're building to make Revenue First testing easier to run in practice. Coming soon.</p>
          <a href="/apps/" class="btn btn--secondary" style="margin-top:12px;">See what's coming</a>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h3>Real talk, no fluff</h3>
          <p class="muted">No branding-first, no logo-first, no vanity metrics. Just what a stranger will actually pay for.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--alt">
    <div class="container" style="text-align:center;">
      <h2>Start with the framework. It's free.</h2>
      <p class="lede" style="margin:0 auto 24px;">The full Student Guide walks you through the Value Stack, Proof Rounds, and exactly what to ask a real buyer.</p>
      <a href="/the-first-strategy/" class="btn btn--primary">Get The First Strategy Guide</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
